{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battleboat</strong> \u2013 Prepare to test your strategic skills in a single-player showdown against a cunning(little bit) CPU opponent. <strong>Battleboat</strong> offers an interactive experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/BB_header.png?t=1745484917\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Single-Player combat:</strong> Engage in tactical battles against the CPU which adapts its strategy after every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Diverse Fleet:</strong> Command a variety of ship types \u2013 from sleek boat and robust cruiser to formidable destroyer \u2013 each with its own unique placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Interactive Graphical Interface:</strong> Enjoy a visually simple and non-bloated interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Smart CPU Logic:</strong> Watch as the AI analyzes your ship placements and makes calculated moves to try and outsmart you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the battle and master the art of tactical warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/extras/BB_main.png?t=1745484917\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628520?t=1745484917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628520?t=1745484917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628520/7013bf54d5bd52c89835a3305fb231a7f3e8bdf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745484917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto